t of findings with severity, file, line, and suggestion\n  - Overall assessment (Approve / Request Changes / Comment)\ntools:\n  - read_file\n  - write_file\n  - edit_file\n  - glob\n  - grep\n  - bash\npermissions:\n  read_file: auto\n  write_file: prompt\n  edit_file: prompt\n  glob: auto\n  grep: auto\n  bash: prompt\nmetadata:\n  version: "1.0"\n  agent-author: User\n---\n\n# reviewer\n\n"Code review specialist focusing on code quality, security, and best practices"\n\n## Configuration\n\nThis agent is configured with the standard toolset. Modify the frontmatter to customize tools, permissions, and model.', 'path': '.agents/agents/reviewer.md'} output=started
