 Delegate user interaction to callback, support fixed choices | CLI callback |\n| **PlanTool** | Delegate plan approval to callback, validate structure | CLI callback |\n| **PermissionGate** | Check permissions (always/auto/prompt), check bash deny list, manage allow/deny lists | DenyList |\n| **PathValidation** | Resolve & validate paths within project root, prevent traversal | - |\n| **DenyList** | Define dangerous patterns, check commands | - |\n| **Truncation** | Truncate output to max size, add notice | - |\n| **Config** | Load from env files, provide defaults, validate | python-dotenv |\n| **Skill** | Load SKILL.md with frontmatter, format for prompt | PyYAML |\n| **SkillLoader** | Discover skills, load & cache, format for prompt | Skill, PyYAML |\n| **Agent** | Load agent .md with frontmatter, format for prompt | PyYAML |\n| **AgentLoader** | Discover agents, load agents.md default, cache & retrieve, format for prompt | Agent, PyYAML |\n| **SystemPrompt** | Build system prompt template, inject tools/skills/agents, load AGENT.md, build normalizer prompt | Config, ToolRegistry, SkillLoader, AgentLoader |\n| **Logger** | Setup rotating file + console logging, provide typed log functions | logging, RotatingFileHandler |'} output=Written 12823 chars to docs/architecture/responsibility_matrix.mermaid
