2026-11-10 00:29:26 [INFO] agentic_cli: TOOL_CALL: write_file args={'path': 'docs/architecture/sequence_diagrams.mermaid', 'content': '```mermaid\n%% Sequence Diagram - Main Agent Loop Flow\n\nsequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor User\n    participant CLI\n    participant InputNormalizer as Input Normalizer Loop\n    participant AgentLoop as Main Agent Loop\n    participant Provider\n    participant ToolRegistry\n    participant PermissionGate\n    participant CompletionResolver\n    participant Tools as Tool Implementations\n\n    Note over User, Tools: Initialization Phase\n    User->>CLI: Start CLI\n    CLI->>CLI: Load Config from .env\n    CLI->>Provider: Create OpenAICompatibleProvider\n    CLI->>ToolRegistry: Create & register all tools\n    CLI->>PermissionGate: Create PermissionGate\n    CLI->>SkillLoader: Discover skills\n    CLI->>AgentLoader: Discover agents\n    CLI->>SystemPrompt: Build system prompt\n    CLI->>AgentLoop: Create main AgentLoop\n    CLI->>AgentLoop: Create input normalizer AgentLoop\n    CLI->>CompletionResolver: Create CompletionResolver\n    CLI-->>User: Ready (show model, skills, agents)\n\n    Note over User, Tools: Main Interaction Loop\n    loop User Interaction\n        User->>CLI: Enter request\n        CLI->>InputNormalizer: Add user message (normalization prompt)\n        InputNormalizer->>Provider: complete(system, messages, tools=[])\n        Provider-->>InputNormalizer: ModelResponse (normalized request)\n        InputNormalizer-->>CLI: Normalized request\n        CLI->>CLI: Display normalized request\n        CLI->>AgentLoop: Add user message (normalized request)\n        \n        Note over AgentLoop, Tools: Agent Reasoning Loop\n        loop Agent Steps (max_steps)\n            AgentLoop->>Provider: complete(system, messages, tools=schemas)\n            Provider-->>AgentLoop: ModelResponse\n            \n            alt Has Reasoning Blocks\n                AgentLoop->>CLI: reasoning_callback(reasoning)\n                CLI-->>User: Display reasoning panel\n            end\n            \n            alt Has Tool Calls\n                loop For each ToolCall\n                    AgentLoop->>PermissionGate: check(tool_name, args)\n                    PermissionGate-->>AgentLoop: (allowed, reason)\n                    \n                    alt Permission Denied\n                        AgentLoop->>AgentLoop: Create ToolResult (error: permission denied)\n                    else Permission Granted\n                        AgentLoop->>CLI: tool_callback(tool_name, args, "started", false)\n                        CLI-->>User: Display tool starting\n                        AgentLoop->>ToolRegistry: execute(tool_name, **args)\n                        ToolRegistry->>Tools: tool.execute(**args)\n                        Tools-->>ToolRegistry: result string\n                        ToolRegistry-->>AgentLoop: result string\n                        AgentLoop->>CLI: tool_callback(tool_name, args, result, is_error)\n                        CLI-->>User: Display tool result\n                        AgentLoop->>AgentLoop: Create ToolResult (output, is_error)\n                    end\n                    AgentLoop->>AgentLoop: Add ToolResult to messages\n                end\n            else No Tool Calls (Text Response)\n                AgentLoop-->>CLI: Return text response\n                break Agent Loop\n            end\n            \n            alt Max Tokens Reached\n                AgentLoop->>AgentLoop: Add continuation message\n                Note right of AgentLoop: Continue loop if under limit\n            end\n            \n            alt Max Steps Reached\n                AgentLoop-->>CLI: Return error\n                break Agent Loop\n            end\n        end\n        \n        Note over CompletionResolver: Completion Review\n        CLI->>CompletionResolver: run(agent, original, normalized)\n        loop Review Attempts (max_completion_attempts)\n            CompletionResolver->>Provider: complete(review_prompt, trace, tools=[])\n            Provider-->>CompletionResolver: ModelResponse (JSON review)\n            CompletionResolver->>CompletionResolver: Parse JSON review\n            \n            alt Complete = true\n                CompletionResolver-->>CLI: CompletionResult(complete=true)\n                break Review Loop\n            else Complete = false\n                CompletionResolver->>AgentLoop: Add user message (review feedback)\n                Note right of CompletionResolver: Retry if attempts remain\n            end\n        end\n        \n        alt Verified Complete\n            CLI-->>User: Display final response (green panel)\n        else Not Verified\n            CLI-->>User: Display response + warning (yellow panel)\n        end\n    end\n    \n    Note over User, Tools: Slash Commands (examples)\n    User->>CLI: /permission allow bash always\n    CLI->>PermissionGate: allow_always("bash")\n    CLI-->>User: Confirmation\n    \n    User->>CLI: /model new-model\n    CLI->>Provider: close()\n    CLI->>Provider: Create new OpenAICompatibleProvider\n    CLI->>AgentLoop: Update provider reference\n    CLI-->>User: Confirmation\n    \n    User->>CLI: /clear\n    CLI->>AgentLoop: clear_history()\n    CLI->>PermissionGate: reset()\n    CLI-->>User: History cleared\n    \n    User->>CLI: /exit\n    CLI->>Provider: close()\n    CLI-->>User: Goodbye\n```\n\n```mermaid\n%% Sequence Diagram - Tool Execution Flow (Detail)\n\nsequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    participant AgentLoop\n    participant PermissionGate\n    participant ToolRegistry\n    participant Tool\n    participant PathValidation\n    participant Truncation\n    participant DenyList\n    participant FileSystem\n    participant CLI\n\n    Note over AgentLoop, CLI: Tool Execution: read_file\n    AgentLoop->>PermissionGate: check("read_file", {"path": "src/main.py"})\n    PermissionGate-->>AgentLoop: (true, null)\n    AgentLoop->>ToolRegistry: execute("read_file", path="src/main.py")\n    ToolRegistry->>Tool: read_file.execute(path="src/main.py")\n    Tool->>PathValidation: validate_path(project_root, "src/main.py")\n    PathValidation-->>Tool: validated_path (absolute)\n    Tool->>FileSystem: open(validated_path).readlines()\n    FileSystem-->>Tool: lines[]\n    Tool->>Tool: Apply offset/limit\n    Tool->>Truncation: truncate(output)\n    Truncation-->>Tool: truncated_output\n    Tool-->>ToolRegistry: result string\n    ToolRegistry-->>AgentLoop: result string\n    AgentLoop->>CLI: tool_callback("read_file", args, result, false)\n    CLI-->>AgentLoop: (displayed)\n\n    Note over AgentLoop, CLI: Tool Execution: write_file\n    AgentLoop->>PermissionGate: check("write_file", {"path": "new.txt", "content": "hello"})\n    PermissionGate->>CLI: _permission_callback (interactive prompt)\n    CLI-->>User: Display permission prompt\n    User->>CLI: "a" (allow always)\n    CLI->>PermissionGate: allow_always("write_file")\n    PermissionGate-->>AgentLoop: (true, null)\n    AgentLoop->>ToolRegistry: execute("write_file", path="new.txt", content="hello")\n    ToolRegistry->>Tool: write_file.execute(path="new.txt", content="hello")\n    Tool->>PathValidation: validate_path(project_root, "new.txt")\n    PathValidation-->>Tool: validated_path\n    Tool->>FileSystem: mkdir(parents), write(content)\n    FileSystem-->>Tool: success\n    Tool-->>ToolRegistry: "Written 5 chars to new.txt"\n    ToolRegistry-->>AgentLoop: result string\n\n    Note over AgentLoop, CLI: Tool Execution: bash (with deny list)\n    AgentLoop->>PermissionGate: check("bash", {"command": "rm -rf /"})\n    PermissionGate->>DenyList: check_deny_list("rm -rf /")\n    DenyList-->>PermissionGate: true (denied)\n    PermissionGate-->>AgentLoop: (false, "Command matches deny list")\n    AgentLoop->>AgentLoop: Create ToolResult (error: permission denied)\n    Note right of AgentLoop: Tool not executed\n```\n\n```mermaid\n%% Sequence Diagram - Completion Review Flow\n\nsequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    participant CLI\n    participant CompletionResolver\n    participant AgentLoop\n    participant Provider\n    participant Logger\n\n    CLI->>CompletionResolver: run(agent, original_request, normalized_request)\n    \n    loop Attempt 1 to max_attempts\n        CompletionResolver->>AgentLoop: run()\n        Note over AgentLoop: Full agent reasoning loop\n        AgentLoop-->>CompletionResolver: final_response\n        \n        alt Model Output Limit Error\n            CompletionResolver-->>CLI: CompletionResult(complete=false, error)\n            break\n        end\n        \n        CompletionResolver->>CompletionResolver: _build_review_input(original, normalized, response, agent)\n        Note right of CompletionResolver: Includes full conversation trace as JSON\n        \n        CompletionResolver->>Provider: complete(review_system_prompt, [review_message], tools=[])\n        Provider-->>CompletionResolver: ModelResponse (JSON)\n        \n        CompletionResolver->>CompletionResolver: _parse_review(blocks)\n        Note right of CompletionResolver: Extract JSON, validate complete boolean\n        \n        alt Review Complete = true\n            Logger->>Logger: log_info("COMPLETION_REVIEW: complete=True")\n            CompletionResolver-->>CLI: CompletionResult(complete=true, findings)\n            break\n        else Review Complete = false\n            Logger->>Logger: log_warning("COMPLETION_REVIEW: complete=False findings=...")\n            CompletionResolver->>AgentLoop: add_user_message(feedback)\n            Note right of CompletionResolver: Inject review feedback for retry\n        end\n    end\n    \n    alt Max Attempts Reached\n        CompletionResolver-->>CLI: CompletionResult(complete=false, findings)\n    end\n```\n\n```mermaid\n%% Sequence Diagram - Input Normalization Flow\n\nsequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    participant User\n    participant CLI\n    participant InputNormalizer\n    participant Provider\n\n    User->>CLI: "fix the bug in login"\n    CLI->>InputNormalizer: Add user message with normalization prompt\n    Note right of InputNormalizer: Prompt: "Analyze user input... Return normalized objective and tasks in English"\n    InputNormalizer->>Provider: complete(normalizer_system, [user_message], tools=[])\n    Provider-->>InputNormalizer: ModelResponse\n    InputNormalizer-->>CLI: "User wants to achieve: Fix login bug\\nTasks:\\n- Identify login issue\\n- Implement fix\\n- Test login"\n    CLI->>CLI: Display normalized input (cyan panel)\n    CLI->>AgentLoop: Add user message (normalized)\n    Note over CLI, AgentLoop: Main agent loop begins with clear, structured request\n```'} output=started
